# Untitled

Applying reticular synthesis to the design of Cu-based MOFs with mechanically interlocked linkers
Alexander J. Stirk<sup>1</sup>, Benjamin H. Wilson<sup>1</sup>, Christopher A. O'Keefe<sup>1</sup>, Hazem Amarne<sup>2</sup>, Kelong Zhu<sup>3</sup>, Robert W. Schurko<sup>4</sup>, and Stephen J. Loeb<sup>1</sup> (✉)
